speechtext:
1.	How many persons were registered with the national employment offices in (a) Trois-Rivieres;
(b)	Sorel; (c) Drummondville, in the province of Quebec, on the 1st of January, 1950, 1951, 1952, 1953, 1954 and 1955?
2.	How many of these persons were in receipt of unemployment insurance benefits at the same dates?
